{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、3月11日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東日本大震災から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年たちました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時わたしは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校から、具合が悪くて早退してて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんとお家にいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急に揺れて、いつも言われてるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きい机の下に もぐりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんと机の下で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐ収まるよね、大丈夫だよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて言ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも揺れは収まらなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと、強くなってきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖くて、外にいる家族が頭に浮かんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がでてきて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビをつけてみたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北の方とか、ひどいみたいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映像も流れてて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、なにこれ⁇どうなってるの⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って呆然としました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も、たくさん震災についての"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組がやっていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長周期地震動で、高層ビルまでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐらぐら揺れて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"防波堤 防潮堤を超えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"波が、街を飲み込んでいって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"液状化現象で、地面から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水や砂が出てきて車なんて進めなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"津波の予想が大きくなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被害が大きくなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映像で見ているだけでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心臓が、ぎゅっと痛くなるのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際に被災した方々は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな気持ちだったろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が住んでいる街が崩れてくのを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな気持ちで見ていたんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く避難しろと、簡単に言うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それさえ難しくてどうしようもなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな生きるために必死で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか、心を打たれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前は ただの小学生で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来る事といっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募金とか、寄付とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぐらいしか出来なかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれから1年が経って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは 乃木坂46、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年とは違う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにかが出来るはず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに笑顔を届けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも、幸せな気持ちをあげたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしたちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ未熟です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、出来ることは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯やりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで、ファンのみなさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛を届けたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/asuka_20120312_blog.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきの乃木どこ⁇で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの顔がとてつもなく残念でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"萎え萎え萎え←←"}],"source":"archive"}